suggesting," said Omer Esiner, chief market analyst at \uc2 Commonwealth \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in a note to clients.\par \par \uc2 The dollar fell against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of commodity producers, as oil prices rose. The greenback was recently down 1.2% against the Brazilian real at 3.4750. It gave up 1.1% against the Mexican peso, to 17.98.\par \par \uc2 Write to Ira Iosebashvili at ira.iosebashvili@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 10-05-16 2128GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020160510ec5a000gv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
