\par\par \b \uc2 Japan MOF confirms Tokyo stayed away from  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  markets in March\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2016\par 12:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, March 31 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets between Feb. 26 and March 29, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday, even as the yen surged to a 17-month high earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 On March 17, the dollar fell to 110.67 yen, its lowest since October 2014, after the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  pared back expectations for interest rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 In a shift that took less than a minute, the greenback bounced back to 110.70 yen on speculation that the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  had been checking prices - a move often seen as a threat or precursor to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A source familiar with the matter quickly dismissed such speculation, saying that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was asking market participants about the causes of the yen's moves against the dollar but was not specifically checking rates.\par \par \uc2 While global concerns over a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war linger, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stayed away from the markets since it last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in November 2011 to stem a strong yen.\par \par \uc2 The yen was trading at around 112.32 versus the dollar on Thursday, still close to its strongest in more than a year, cooling sentiment among exporters and weighing on Japan's fight against deflation. (Reporting by Tetsushi Kajimoto; Editing by Nick Macfie)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-4-3T10:57:51.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160331ec3v00upl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
