uc2 \f2 Bank of Japan\f28 \uc2 \f2  may call an emergency meeting to undertake additional monetary easing if financial markets remain turbulent.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Lawmakers Pepper Yellen With Financial Regulation Questions\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fed Chairwoman \f28 \uc2 \f2 Janet Yellen\f28 \uc2 \f2  faced pointed questions from lawmakers in both parties about the Fed's handling of financial regulation, the latest evidence of the political minefield the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is navigating ahead of some critical decisions this year. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Other News: \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 EU\f28 \uc2 \f2  Opens Three Investigations on China Steel Imports\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 European Commission\f28 \uc2 \f2  on Friday opened three investigations into allegations of unfair trade practices by Chinese steel manufacturers to determine whether imported steel products were being sold in the \f28 \uc2 \f2 EU\f28 \uc2 \f2  at below-market prices, hurting European producers.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Thyssenkrupp Swings to Net Loss\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 German industrial conglomerate \f28 \uc2 \f2 Thyssenkrupp AG\f28 \uc2 \f2  swung to a first-quarter loss, hurt by weakness in the steel and materials businesses as well as high tax expenses.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Renault Profit Jumps Despite Russia Loss\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 French auto maker Renault reported a jump in profit and raised its dividend despite a loss at its Russian unit.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Glaxo Fined $53 Million in Generic Drug Delay Ruling\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The U.K.'s competition regulator has imposed a fine on the pharmaceutical company \f28 \uc2 \f2 GlaxoSmithKline\f28 \uc2 \f2  for trying to delay the potential entry of competitors into the U.K. generic-drugs market for antidepressant drug paroxetine.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 World Powers Agree to Cease-Fire in Syria\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 World powers agreed on a cease-fire in Syria in one week's time, giving Russia a chance to help the Assad regime press an offensive that has expanded the Kremlin's clout in the region.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Google Bends to European Pressure on Right to be Forgotten Rule\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Alphabet Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s \f28 \uc2 \f2 Google\f28 \uc2 \f2  will expand how it applies Europe's right-to-be-forgotten rule for search engines, bending to demands from privacy regulators.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Facebook Moves to Find, Block Terrorist Content\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Facebook\f28 \uc2 \f2 , under pressure from government officials, is more aggressively policing material it views as supporting terrorism.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Sarka Halas at sarka.halas@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 February 12, 2016 06:37 ET (11:37 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160212ec2c001jm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
